Bundle-Name: CQRS Library
Bundle-SymbolicName: org.workflow.cqrs
Bundle-Version: 0.2.1
Bundle-License: http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Bundle-Description: This repository contains a lightweight \
 implementation of the Command Query Responsibility Segregation \
 (CQRS) pattern written in 100% Java. It provides abstractions \
 for Commands, Queries, and their respective handlers, enabling \
 clear separation between write and read operations. \
 The library supports extensible pipelines for validation, \
 logging, and idempotency, and is designed to integrate \
 seamlessly with event-driven architectures and microservices. \
 Core components include command dispatching, query handling, \
 and customizable execution flows, allowing developers to build \
 scalable and maintainable systems with minimal boilerplate.

Bundle-DocURL: https://github.com/CQRS-Library-Architecture/cqrs-lib-v2

Export-Package: org.workflow.cqrs.api;-noimport:=true

-exportcontents: org.workflow.cqrs
-importpackage: *
-conditionalpackage: *
-includeresource: *
-baseline: *
-baselinerepo: Released